{
 "encounter_id": "00621",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Good afternoon, doctor. I appreciate you fitting me in. My wife thinks I should have this looked at, so here I am. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Happy to. Tell me, in your own words, what's been bothering you? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Well, I snore, apparently. Quite loudly. But the thing that actually worries me is that I fall asleep in meetings."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How often is that happening, the falling asleep?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two or three times a week now. Last Thursday I nodded off while presenting the quarterly numbers. It was mortifying."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That sounds exhausting. And the snoring, does anyone say anything else about your nights?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My wife says I stop breathing for a few seconds and then gasp. She finds it frightening. I've been snoring for years, but it's worse the last six months."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Anything else you've noticed, mornings in particular?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes, I wake up with a dull headache most days. Morning headaches, right across the front, gone by lunchtime."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain, or pain in your chest when you walk up stairs?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chest pain, no."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And any swelling in your legs by evening?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No swelling of the legs. My ankles are fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Now, what medicines do you take?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Lisinopril, 10 mg once a day, every morning without fail. Metformin 500 mg twice a day, although if I'm honest I skip the evening one when dinner runs late."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay, so the metformin is prescribed twice a day but some evenings it doesn't get taken. That's useful to know, thank you. Any allergies to medicines?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sulfa drugs. I came out in hives once when I was given an antibiotic."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Noted. And your wider history, the diabetes, the blood pressure, anything else?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes for about eight years, high blood pressure, and high cholesterol. They're managed, I believe."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any operations?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I had a knee replacement, the right one, in 2019."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any sleep apnoea or diabetes in the family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My mother had diabetes. As far as I know there's no sleep trouble in the family."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And what do you do for work, and do you drink?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'm an accountant. I'll have two beers on a Saturday, no more than that."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thank you. Let me check your numbers. Your breathing, any cough or breathlessness, first?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, my breathing's fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 82, blood pressure 142 over 88, temperature 36.6, oxygen 96 percent, breathing 16 times a minute. You weigh 104 kilos and you're 178 centimetres, so your BMI is 32.8.",
   "pause": 20.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the blood pressure a problem? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's a bit higher than I'd like, and I think the sleep issue may be part of it. Open wide for me, say ahh. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ahh. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Your airway is narrow at the back of the throat, your lungs are clear, and your heart sounds are normal.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "So what do you make of it all? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Given the snoring, the pauses your wife sees, the daytime sleepiness and the morning headaches, this fits best with obstructive sleep apnoea."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I've read a bit about that. Is it dangerous? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Untreated it can raise blood pressure and strain the heart, and it's risky if you're drowsy at the wheel. That's why we should sort it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Understood. What happens next? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to arrange a sleep study, which you do at home with a small monitor overnight."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "At home is convenient. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll also order blood tests, including your HbA1c and thyroid, and let's do an ECG here today to check your heart."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "All right. And in the meantime? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Avoid drinking in the evening, try sleeping on your side, and please don't drive when you feel drowsy."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I'll be careful. How soon will I hear? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Come back and see me in three weeks and we'll go through all the results together."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. Thank you, doctor, I feel much better having a plan. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good. See you then. ~"
  }
 ],
